  "prefLabel": "Fire 101.10 Director",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fire 101.10 “Director” means the director of the division of fire standards and training and emergency medical services of the department of safety, as defined in RSA 21-P:25, II(b).\n\nSource (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Fire 100) #12225-A, eff 6-28-17",
